    <item>
      <title>Build Environment</title>
      <link>https://scratch3-tello.app/docs/development/build-env/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://scratch3-tello.app/docs/development/build-env/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;build-environment&#34;&gt;Build Environment&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#build-environment&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;scratch3-tello&lt;/code&gt; repository contains per-file diffs for the &lt;code&gt;scratch-vm&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;scratch-gui&lt;/code&gt; repositories. To build Scratch3-Tello, you need to clone &lt;code&gt;scratch-vm&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;scratch-gui&lt;/code&gt; and then apply the diffs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#requirements&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;wget&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;git&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;node.js&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;npm&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;create-a-working-directory&#34;&gt;Create a working directory&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#create-a-working-directory&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ mkdir scratch3-tello&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ cd scratch3-tello&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;download-the-build-script&#34;&gt;Download the build script&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#download-the-build-script&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kebhr/scratch3-tello/master/build.sh&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ chmod +x build.sh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;run-the-build-script&#34;&gt;Run the build script&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#run-the-build-script&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ ./build.sh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Running &lt;code&gt;build.sh&lt;/code&gt; will automatically clone &lt;code&gt;scratch-vm&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;scratch-gui&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;scratch-desktop&lt;/code&gt;, and apply the diff files managed by the &lt;code&gt;scratch3-tello&lt;/code&gt; repository.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Internationalization</title>
      <link>https://scratch3-tello.app/docs/development/i18n/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://scratch3-tello.app/docs/development/i18n/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;internationalization&#34;&gt;Internationalization&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#internationalization&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;NOTE: Pull requests are always welcome to add or update translations. If you can translate but are not familiar with GitHub, please &lt;a href=&#34;../../contact/&#34;&gt;contact me&lt;/a&gt;, and I will add your translation to Scratch3-Tello.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Block names are defined in &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/kebhr/scratch3-tello/blob/master/scratch-vm/src/extensions/scratch3_tello/index.js&#34;&gt;scratch-vm/src/extensions/scratch3_tello/index.js&lt;/a&gt;. The &lt;code&gt;message&lt;/code&gt; object defined in this file is used for i18n.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;message[&#39;internal block code&#39;][&#39;language code&#39;]&lt;/code&gt; represents the block&amp;rsquo;s display name in the specified language.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;example&#34;&gt;Example&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#example&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For example, let&amp;rsquo;s translate the &lt;code&gt;takeoff&lt;/code&gt; block into German. Currently, &lt;code&gt;message[&#39;takeoff&#39;]&lt;/code&gt; looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
